- * LOCKING:
- * There are three level of locking required by epoll :
+ * fs/eventpoll.c - Efficient event polling ("epoll") kernel implementation.
  *
- * 1) epnested_mutex (mutex)
- * 2) ep->mtx (mutex)
- * 3) ep->lock (spinlock)
